WEBVTT

01:30.180 --> 01:34.750
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.210 --> 01:37.850
[Episode 24]

01:58.280 --> 01:58.950
Go!

01:59.120 --> 01:59.789
All leave!

02:00.230 --> 02:01.550
You all never listen to me,

02:01.550 --> 02:04.480
insisting on going to the West Coast
to get yourselves killed!

02:04.480 --> 02:05.400
I said I would go for you,

02:05.400 --> 02:06.600
but you didn't let me!

02:07.330 --> 02:09.280
You insisted on bringing Wu Huan with you.

02:09.280 --> 02:09.880
Fine then!

02:10.330 --> 02:12.860
Let that traitor Wu Huan
betray you once more!

02:13.190 --> 02:14.590
If you don't make it back,

02:15.240 --> 02:18.570
I won't take care
of the Demons' Valley anymore!

02:28.290 --> 02:28.890
Hong Ye.

02:30.250 --> 02:31.110
Are you afraid?

02:34.750 --> 02:36.120
No matter how hard it is,

02:36.750 --> 02:37.810
with you by my side,

02:38.079 --> 02:39.020
I'm not afraid.

02:40.480 --> 02:41.340
What about you?

02:44.280 --> 02:44.920
Same.

02:46.360 --> 02:47.120
I am afraid.

02:47.350 --> 02:48.790
There's a storm ahead.

03:03.470 --> 03:04.290
Hold on to me.

03:06.630 --> 03:07.350
Hold tight!

03:42.650 --> 03:43.579
Don't be afraid.

03:45.110 --> 03:45.970
I'm not afraid.

04:08.900 --> 04:09.500
My Lord,

04:09.860 --> 04:11.490
down there is the West Coast.

04:20.860 --> 04:21.390
Let's go.

04:22.070 --> 04:23.070
Don't go down yet.

04:23.610 --> 04:25.360
The Treasure Swallower
guards the Treasury all day.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.560
We'll wait until it's fast asleep,

04:26.560 --> 04:28.220
then seize the chance to move.

04:29.120 --> 04:29.610
Mm.

04:32.440 --> 04:34.570
If you're tired, you can get some rest.

04:36.640 --> 04:38.170
Honestly, I am a bit sleepy.

05:07.110 --> 05:07.900
Wake up.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.000
Judging from the sound,

05:22.000 --> 05:23.310
it's a giant behemoth.

05:24.270 --> 05:25.470
Following the sound,

05:25.540 --> 05:26.940
we can find the entrance.

05:53.060 --> 05:53.710
Wu Huan,

05:53.740 --> 05:54.850
wait for us here.

05:55.150 --> 05:56.400
If something goes wrong,

05:56.400 --> 05:57.630
take Xiao Yao away first.

05:57.630 --> 05:57.950
Mm.

05:58.020 --> 05:59.220
Don't be so negative.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.080
I mean, "if."

06:02.190 --> 06:03.160
There's no "if."

06:03.560 --> 06:04.090
Let's go.

06:17.500 --> 06:18.210
Look!

06:18.830 --> 06:19.800
I'll conjure up

06:19.800 --> 06:20.860
as many as you want.

06:21.030 --> 06:21.910
Let's hurry.

06:36.430 --> 06:38.200
Oh, my goodness!

06:55.600 --> 06:56.130
Let's go.

07:02.110 --> 07:02.830
There are so many of them.

07:02.830 --> 07:04.270
Where do we even start?

07:12.810 --> 07:14.290
So many.

07:20.600 --> 07:22.060
It doesn't seem to be here.

07:22.200 --> 07:23.730
Let's look somewhere else.

07:24.560 --> 07:25.960
There's more over there.

07:26.390 --> 07:27.510
Come on. Let's go.

07:49.130 --> 07:50.960
These stones do look like it,

07:51.340 --> 07:53.870
but they don't seem
to be the spiritual stone.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.530
Never mind.

08:02.570 --> 08:03.910
Just take all the ones that look like it.

08:03.910 --> 08:06.440
You check this side,
and I'll check that side.

08:29.970 --> 08:30.550
Xiao Yao,

08:30.750 --> 08:31.420
stop looking.

08:31.420 --> 08:32.260
There's something.

08:32.260 --> 08:33.850
What is it? Bring it here.

08:34.030 --> 08:34.960
Don't shout.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.220
I can't take it.

08:41.340 --> 08:43.710
[Treasure Swallower]

08:42.909 --> 08:44.190
No... Don't come over!

08:44.320 --> 08:45.030
I just wanted to take a look.

08:45.030 --> 08:46.630
I-I'll give them back to you.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.910
Don't eat us!

08:49.910 --> 08:50.510
Don't be afraid.

08:50.510 --> 08:51.440
Wait a moment.

08:51.440 --> 08:51.960
I...

08:51.960 --> 08:53.420
Let me show you something.

08:53.670 --> 08:54.200
This one.

09:11.150 --> 09:11.810
I have more.

09:15.700 --> 09:17.830
This tastes even better than that one.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.670
Delicious!

09:30.670 --> 09:32.030
I want more! More!

09:34.670 --> 09:36.290
I have more! There's more!

09:36.550 --> 09:37.240
Hurry!

09:51.080 --> 09:53.160
It's so sweet.

09:53.400 --> 09:55.360
These are your provisions
for the journey back.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.830
Stop talking.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.120
Why did you bring so little?

10:00.530 --> 10:02.770
You two little things,

10:02.790 --> 10:04.920
how dare you come to steal my treasures?

10:04.920 --> 10:06.680
This is unforgivable!

10:07.240 --> 10:07.840
Stop!

10:08.030 --> 10:08.990
You've eaten our food,

10:08.990 --> 10:10.440
and we've returned all your treasures.

10:10.440 --> 10:12.900
If you have any problem,
come at me, the lord.

10:18.010 --> 10:21.430
How dare you call yourself "lord"
in my presence?

10:22.270 --> 10:24.950
Sir, he is Hong Ye,
the Monarch of All Demons.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.120
Hong Ye?

10:26.240 --> 10:26.790
Yes.

10:29.830 --> 10:31.950
I've heard of him.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.350
However,

10:33.480 --> 10:37.380
I only care about treasures here,

10:37.750 --> 10:40.200
not about lords or monarchs.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.510
I just

10:41.510 --> 10:43.910
caught a falcon outside.
A really nice one.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.510
This Little Lord can stay

10:45.510 --> 10:47.120
to tend to my bird

10:47.120 --> 10:49.650
-and join me to have fun with it.
-How dare you!

10:50.320 --> 10:51.670
You old jerk.

10:56.030 --> 10:59.530
Little thing, you are so boring

10:59.780 --> 11:00.810
and utterly dull.

11:03.080 --> 11:05.380
I'll swallow you in one go!

11:05.840 --> 11:07.030
No, no, sir!

11:07.030 --> 11:08.240
H-He's not edible.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.000
He stinks!

11:10.910 --> 11:11.510
He stinks?

11:11.790 --> 11:12.270
Mm!

11:19.980 --> 11:20.570
I stink.

11:23.530 --> 11:25.410
Worse than stinky tofu?

11:25.440 --> 11:26.700
Yeah, worse than that.

11:30.240 --> 11:30.900
No, please!

11:31.210 --> 11:32.150
Please spare him!

11:32.150 --> 11:33.960
We're not here to steal anything.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.670
We

11:34.670 --> 11:36.480
heard that you have
many interesting things here.

11:36.480 --> 11:36.960
We...

11:37.120 --> 11:38.510
We came to visit you and have fun.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.270
Have fun?

11:39.480 --> 11:40.030
Mm.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.200
Wonderful! Great!

11:42.390 --> 11:44.000
I-I love having fun.

11:44.000 --> 11:44.710
Look.

11:45.270 --> 11:48.270
I have so, so many treasures here,

11:48.290 --> 11:50.930
but I don't know how to play with them.

11:53.910 --> 11:54.840
Tell me quickly!

11:55.750 --> 11:57.210
You can play with this one.

11:58.910 --> 12:00.150
Watch carefully.

12:10.180 --> 12:11.370
Nice! This is good!

12:11.840 --> 12:13.120
-I want to play with it, too!
-Have a try.

12:13.120 --> 12:13.760
Come on.

12:14.720 --> 12:15.840
Let me do it.

12:21.270 --> 12:23.630
He doesn't look like he would eat people.

12:23.630 --> 12:25.140
We just need to humor him a bit.

12:25.140 --> 12:25.670
Mm.

12:28.340 --> 12:29.100
Oh, my...

12:32.150 --> 12:34.580
What is this thing called?

12:34.870 --> 12:36.320
This is called pitch-pot.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.380
Based on how the arrows are thrown,

12:38.480 --> 12:39.270
it's divided into

12:39.270 --> 12:39.800
rim shot,

12:40.000 --> 12:40.650
direct handle shot,

12:40.650 --> 12:41.390
backside handle shot,

12:41.390 --> 12:42.080
double shots,

12:42.080 --> 12:42.840
and all-in.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.320
Sir, try again.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.000
You go

12:46.000 --> 12:48.090
pick up all those arrows for me.

12:57.900 --> 13:00.700
A real man knows when to bend
and when to stand firm.

13:02.120 --> 13:02.840
I'll go.

13:04.870 --> 13:05.670
Good boy.

13:10.510 --> 13:12.400
Hurry up.

13:33.360 --> 13:34.890
This is so much fun.

13:34.960 --> 13:36.600
This is really fun.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.380
How about this one?

13:52.200 --> 13:53.790
Be gentle.

13:54.080 --> 13:55.010
What about this?

13:58.390 --> 13:59.640
B-Be gentle!

14:01.170 --> 14:02.840
These are all treasures.

14:05.200 --> 14:06.440
Legend has it

14:06.510 --> 14:09.940
that the Treasure Swallower has been
collecting treasures since ancient times,

14:09.940 --> 14:12.240
but I never expected them
to be such worthless junk.

14:12.240 --> 14:12.910
Well...

14:12.910 --> 14:14.420
You shouldn't say that.

14:14.610 --> 14:17.940
These things are all precious treasures
of the human realm.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.640
Yeah, yeah.

14:19.760 --> 14:22.030
But they're only treasures
if they can be played with.

14:22.030 --> 14:23.390
Then hurry and teach me

14:23.390 --> 14:25.140
how to play with them.

14:26.670 --> 14:28.120
Forgive me for being blunt,

14:28.120 --> 14:29.630
but these things are way too old.

14:29.630 --> 14:30.890
They're missing parts

14:31.150 --> 14:32.670
and need to be repaired first.

14:32.670 --> 14:34.240
Then fix them quickly.

14:35.270 --> 14:35.870
You...

14:36.750 --> 14:37.120
Oh...

14:37.150 --> 14:38.000
Come and help!

14:39.150 --> 14:40.480
He can't make it either.

14:40.600 --> 14:42.240
Repairing these requires tools

14:42.240 --> 14:43.840
that we can only buy outside.

14:45.550 --> 14:46.350
That won't do.

14:46.840 --> 14:48.300
You cannot leave.

14:48.550 --> 14:52.000
You are now my greatest treasure.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.480
Once you're in, you're never getting out.

14:53.480 --> 14:54.210
You old jerk!

14:56.290 --> 14:57.630
Don't push your luck.

14:58.390 --> 15:00.360
Do you know who you're talking to?

15:00.360 --> 15:01.150
Sir, sir!

15:01.840 --> 15:03.500
Don't be mad. Calm down.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.960
Think about it.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.480
If we don't go outside,

15:06.480 --> 15:08.670
then you won't be able to play
with any of your treasures,

15:08.670 --> 15:10.960
and they truly won't count
as treasures anymore.

15:10.960 --> 15:11.720
Besides,

15:11.720 --> 15:13.080
there are many more things outside,

15:13.080 --> 15:15.220
even more than in this Treasury.

15:15.670 --> 15:16.800
Don't you want them?

15:31.310 --> 15:31.880
Girl,

15:32.840 --> 15:35.460
is he your greatest treasure?

15:45.950 --> 15:47.160
If he is,

15:47.190 --> 15:49.560
I'll keep him here

15:50.200 --> 15:51.670
while you go out buying things.

15:51.670 --> 15:52.790
If he isn't,

15:53.310 --> 15:55.680
I've disliked him for a while.

15:56.390 --> 15:58.040
I'll treat him like stinky tofu

15:58.040 --> 15:58.960
and swallow him in one go...

15:58.960 --> 15:59.390
Yes!

16:00.370 --> 16:01.130
He is.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.180
What do you mean?

16:10.240 --> 16:11.000
My treasure.

16:29.350 --> 16:30.960
The restaurant
we dined in last time was quite good.

16:30.960 --> 16:32.600
Yes, I'd like to go there again.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.450
Today's...

16:35.000 --> 16:36.060
What is that thing?

16:40.970 --> 16:42.050
How weird.

16:42.080 --> 16:44.480
The Treasure Swallower only
takes things in, never gives them back.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.550
I've never heard

16:45.550 --> 16:47.620
of anyone taking anything from him.

16:48.230 --> 16:50.360
But it's His Lordship who will suffer,

16:50.560 --> 16:52.330
having to be a hostage there.

16:53.150 --> 16:53.900
It's okay.

16:54.190 --> 16:55.630
Spending money is what I'm best at.

16:55.630 --> 16:57.250
We just need to hurry up
and go back early.

16:57.250 --> 16:57.810
Let's go.

17:31.510 --> 17:33.500
I just can't understand

17:33.610 --> 17:36.650
why that girl would
consider you a treasure.

17:36.790 --> 17:37.720
Keeping you here

17:38.480 --> 17:40.220
will really make her come back?

17:40.640 --> 17:42.240
I hope she doesn't come back,

17:42.960 --> 17:44.980
so she won't be coveted
by an old jerk like you.

17:44.980 --> 17:46.910
So you like her, too?

17:49.310 --> 17:50.270
"Too"?

17:50.340 --> 17:52.240
You dare fight me for treasure?

17:52.240 --> 17:53.630
You want to die?

17:54.050 --> 17:54.450
You...

17:55.450 --> 17:56.650
Want a fight?

18:03.410 --> 18:05.160
Then tell me.

18:05.160 --> 18:08.110
Do you have more gold and jewels
than I do,

18:08.140 --> 18:11.120
or is your power greater than mine?

18:13.010 --> 18:15.210
I don't need to compare myself with you.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.370
If she's in danger,

18:17.140 --> 18:19.090
I would sacrifice my life to protect her.

18:19.090 --> 18:19.910
How touching.

18:20.380 --> 18:22.280
It's so touching.

18:24.700 --> 18:27.660
After all, you've lost your power,

18:27.690 --> 18:30.020
so sacrificing your life is
all you can do.

18:32.110 --> 18:32.790
However...

18:34.270 --> 18:35.640
Have you told

18:36.160 --> 18:38.860
all this to that girl clearly?

18:38.890 --> 18:40.820
Would she be willing to accept it?

18:41.070 --> 18:42.130
If I'm going to act,

18:42.660 --> 18:43.640
why waste words?

18:44.780 --> 18:47.060
S-So you haven't told her yet.

18:47.210 --> 18:49.470
If you haven't said it, it doesn't count.

18:49.750 --> 18:50.830
Nonsense.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.350
I don't need to explain myself

18:53.350 --> 18:55.750
to you, a Treasure Swallower
who only guards treasures.

18:55.750 --> 18:57.830
I've lived for so long

18:57.830 --> 19:00.160
that there's nothing I don't understand.

19:00.510 --> 19:01.580
You know what?

19:02.270 --> 19:04.400
That girl knows value

19:04.750 --> 19:07.420
and understands what true treasure is.

19:07.720 --> 19:09.720
Collecting treasures with me

19:09.720 --> 19:11.830
and enjoying life
would be the best for her.

19:11.830 --> 19:12.360
Dream on!

19:15.130 --> 19:17.730
I don't allow you
to set your sights on Xiao Yao.

19:19.810 --> 19:22.140
I hold sway over here.

19:22.460 --> 19:24.690
She's already my treasure,

19:25.240 --> 19:26.640
not for you to covet.

19:26.850 --> 19:28.030
Not for you to covet.

19:28.050 --> 19:29.310
Forget it! Forget it!

19:30.510 --> 19:31.270
Screw you.

19:37.370 --> 19:38.110
Try this.

19:41.510 --> 19:42.030
This one.

19:42.030 --> 19:43.830
This one. This one. And this one.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.680
We'll take them all.

19:45.750 --> 19:46.950
Thank you. Thank you.

19:46.960 --> 19:47.510
Hurry.

19:53.000 --> 19:53.750
We want all of them.

19:53.750 --> 19:54.080
Okay.

20:19.940 --> 20:20.820
Take a look.

20:21.440 --> 20:22.920
Come take a look!

20:33.530 --> 20:34.650
And one more.

20:35.420 --> 20:36.810
This is really important.

20:36.810 --> 20:37.410
Sir.

20:38.750 --> 20:39.290
Yes.

20:39.440 --> 20:41.060
We can't buy any more.

20:41.170 --> 20:43.170
If we buy more, I won't be able to fly.

20:45.160 --> 20:45.690
Let's go.

20:51.110 --> 20:51.640
Xiao Yao,

20:52.000 --> 20:53.660
you must be tired. Have a seat.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.880
Old jerk.

21:11.390 --> 21:14.390
You traded one nugget of gold
for all these treasures.

21:15.350 --> 21:17.020
You're the real master here.

21:17.120 --> 21:20.300
I should have let you take more gold.

21:20.830 --> 21:21.760
That was enough.

21:21.950 --> 21:24.880
All these vessels here are rare treasures,

21:25.040 --> 21:27.220
but the food inside them is

21:27.310 --> 21:29.500
the real source of power and spirit.

21:29.540 --> 21:31.520
Without these delicious foods,

21:31.640 --> 21:33.350
these plates would be useless.

21:33.350 --> 21:34.360
Right.

21:34.480 --> 21:36.200
Otherwise, they'd be useless like him,

21:36.200 --> 21:37.200
a complete waste.

21:42.600 --> 21:45.480
Just the smell is refreshing.

21:48.750 --> 21:49.680
This eating...

21:49.840 --> 21:50.530
Eat, eat, eat,

21:50.530 --> 21:51.750
eat, eat, eat!

21:53.840 --> 21:55.350
Eating, drinking, and playing

21:55.350 --> 21:56.900
must be combined

21:56.920 --> 21:58.880
to create maximum pleasure.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.880
I'll listen to you.

22:00.910 --> 22:01.560
Well,

22:01.590 --> 22:02.790
then, tell me

22:02.930 --> 22:05.840
how to combine them for maximum pleasure?

22:17.400 --> 22:18.760
You're awesome!

22:19.740 --> 22:20.600
Check this out.

22:27.080 --> 22:28.720
How could this be?

22:32.620 --> 22:34.680
Xiao Yao, teach me.

22:42.580 --> 22:43.760
You're a real master!

22:43.760 --> 22:45.220
He's cheating! Cheating!

22:45.520 --> 22:46.320
Want to learn?

22:46.880 --> 22:48.030
I'll teach you, sir.

22:56.600 --> 22:59.190
Who allowed you to take food
from Xiao Yao?

22:59.220 --> 23:00.220
Spit it out!

23:03.140 --> 23:04.600
I won this fair and square.

23:04.830 --> 23:06.200
Who allowed you to win?

23:06.230 --> 23:07.820
Did Xiao Yao agree to this?

23:07.840 --> 23:08.950
Disrespect toward Xiao Yao is

23:08.950 --> 23:10.470
disrespect toward me!

23:13.350 --> 23:13.960
After all,

23:14.060 --> 23:16.230
you're still after Xiao Yao, aren't you?

23:16.230 --> 23:18.640
It's you who covets my treasure.

23:33.630 --> 23:34.610
From then on,

23:34.730 --> 23:37.310
Master Ye no longer kept a cold face

23:37.620 --> 23:39.750
and could laugh heartily.

23:42.930 --> 23:45.600
Miss Yao also became a true heroine.

23:48.710 --> 23:51.240
After that,
the two of them traveled together

23:51.310 --> 23:53.030
through mountains and rivers,

23:53.030 --> 23:55.290
enjoying their lives in the human realm.

24:23.590 --> 24:26.080
That's so touching!

24:29.070 --> 24:31.070
I've never heard

24:31.070 --> 24:33.790
such a moving story before.

24:43.130 --> 24:45.510
So that's how the arms and legs move!

25:00.110 --> 25:01.840
Wonderful! Bravo!

25:01.870 --> 25:03.130
This is so interesting!

25:03.130 --> 25:04.380
So fascinating!

25:05.330 --> 25:07.420
I want to learn this! I want to learn!

25:07.680 --> 25:08.400
Well,

25:08.790 --> 25:10.160
it requires finesse,

25:10.240 --> 25:11.460
but your power is too strong.

25:11.460 --> 25:12.500
If you break it,

25:12.530 --> 25:13.930
I'll have to fix it again.

25:15.400 --> 25:17.000
I have so many treasures

25:17.000 --> 25:18.550
that have been sitting here for years.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.510
If I don't take them out
to play with them,

25:19.510 --> 25:21.640
won't they all become
useless waste in the end?

25:21.640 --> 25:22.210
But...

25:22.230 --> 25:23.760
Just teach me.

25:23.850 --> 25:24.350
I...

25:25.240 --> 25:28.170
I'm willing to trade other treasures
for it with you.

25:28.260 --> 25:30.460
You can choose any treasure I have here.

25:32.600 --> 25:34.340
I have so many treasures.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.640
Isn't there

25:36.060 --> 25:38.280
anything you want among them?

25:42.240 --> 25:43.240
Think carefully.

25:49.030 --> 25:50.880
I do want to ask you for a favor,

25:51.340 --> 25:54.000
but I don't want to use this
as a bargaining chip.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.100
Never mind.

25:55.310 --> 25:56.110
I'll teach you

25:56.550 --> 25:57.310
for free.

25:58.000 --> 25:59.270
But whether you can learn it

25:59.270 --> 26:00.750
depends on you.

26:01.410 --> 26:02.470
Alright then.

26:04.270 --> 26:06.480
You need to maintain its balance,

26:06.640 --> 26:08.680
keep this side
facing yourself all the time,

26:08.680 --> 26:09.720
apply force with your arm,

26:09.720 --> 26:10.920
and don't let it fall.

26:10.920 --> 26:11.980
I'm letting go now.

26:13.030 --> 26:13.830
Good, good!

26:14.480 --> 26:15.680
Well done!

26:18.590 --> 26:19.270
Xiao Yao.

26:19.840 --> 26:21.500
If you agree to trade with him,

26:21.550 --> 26:23.530
it won't be as simple as teaching him.

26:23.530 --> 26:25.100
He surely wants you to stay.

26:25.320 --> 26:27.250
I don't want the Sky Stone anymore.

26:27.310 --> 26:28.720
You should find a chance

26:29.160 --> 26:31.090
to escape from this place quickly.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.880
H-How did it get tangled?

26:32.880 --> 26:34.140
You could untangle it.

26:36.310 --> 26:37.070
No rush.

26:37.380 --> 26:39.730
If he sees these things as treasures,

26:40.070 --> 26:42.260
then he can't be a greedy person.

26:42.750 --> 26:44.200
I want to give it a try
with sincerity first.

26:44.200 --> 26:44.680
No.

26:45.160 --> 26:47.360
I can't risk your safety no matter what.

26:48.230 --> 26:49.960
What are you two talking about?

26:52.020 --> 26:52.800
Nothing.

26:53.420 --> 26:55.280
Just complimenting your skills.

26:58.480 --> 26:59.110
Pick one.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.920
One more!

27:11.790 --> 27:12.590
Brilliant.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.030
Impressive!

27:17.030 --> 27:17.930
Let me try!

27:27.190 --> 27:28.760
You need to go from here to here,

27:28.760 --> 27:30.000
aiming at that bell,

27:30.400 --> 27:31.860
drawing the bow steadily.

27:31.960 --> 27:32.470
Three.

27:33.000 --> 27:33.400
Two.

27:33.640 --> 27:34.110
One.

27:34.130 --> 27:34.830
Release!

27:34.830 --> 27:35.890
Hong Ye, watch out!

27:36.210 --> 27:37.800
No! Don't aim at people.

27:37.830 --> 27:39.180
You need to aim at that bell.

27:39.180 --> 27:40.310
Give it another try.

27:40.520 --> 27:42.720
Should I close my left eye or right eye?

27:42.750 --> 27:43.830
Either is fine.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.160
Aim at the bell, okay?

27:47.640 --> 27:48.110
One.

27:48.330 --> 27:48.790
Two.

27:49.000 --> 27:49.480
Three.

27:53.820 --> 27:55.090
Good, not bad.

28:03.270 --> 28:04.070
What's wrong?

28:05.430 --> 28:06.970
Why is there a smell?

28:07.950 --> 28:09.210
The smell of jealousy.

28:17.070 --> 28:17.960
I know

28:17.960 --> 28:20.350
My Lord has suffered
some grievances lately.

28:20.350 --> 28:22.160
If this were back in the old days,
you would have

28:22.160 --> 28:23.960
totally wrecked this Treasury.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.640
But just because of this,

28:25.710 --> 28:27.630
I admire you even more, My Lord.

28:27.790 --> 28:30.450
You're enduring
what others cannot put up with.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.550
On a personal level,

28:31.550 --> 28:33.550
this is how a real man should behave.

28:33.960 --> 28:35.020
On a greater scale,

28:35.110 --> 28:37.770
you're concerned
about the lives of all demons,

28:37.790 --> 28:39.920
using every last one of your faculties.

28:39.920 --> 28:42.810
My Lord,
you know you carry the fate of demons.

28:43.000 --> 28:44.750
Sure enough, you would do anything

28:44.750 --> 28:46.150
to recover your power...

28:50.030 --> 28:50.830
Who told you

28:50.830 --> 28:53.290
that I would do anything
to recover my power?

28:55.210 --> 28:56.740
If it means sacrificing you

28:56.760 --> 28:58.910
and leaving you here forever
to entertain him,

28:58.910 --> 29:01.240
I'd rather not
have this power back at all.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.840
I want to protect you,

29:06.790 --> 29:08.760
not just to keep you alive.

29:10.060 --> 29:11.380
I don't want you

29:11.570 --> 29:13.910
to be constrained by anything
or lose your freedom

29:13.910 --> 29:14.910
because of me.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.070
Xiao Yao,

29:42.720 --> 29:44.190
he's so boring.

29:44.250 --> 29:45.360
Why don't you

29:45.850 --> 29:49.050
join me
and play with this luminous pearl instead?

29:54.270 --> 29:55.000
Sir,

29:55.310 --> 29:56.960
you have plenty of luminous pearls here.

29:56.960 --> 29:59.160
How about
I show you something else to play with?

29:59.160 --> 30:01.200
Nice! Okay!

30:06.840 --> 30:07.610
Come on!

30:11.060 --> 30:12.470
Run faster!

30:12.500 --> 30:14.150
Faster! Faster!

30:16.100 --> 30:17.390
It's flying!

30:17.790 --> 30:18.860
Come on, faster.

30:18.990 --> 30:19.920
Great! Amazing!

30:21.550 --> 30:22.680
Not bad, old man!

30:22.680 --> 30:24.200
Your eagle flies so high.

30:25.030 --> 30:25.860
Take it.

30:38.470 --> 30:39.920
I'm exhausted.

30:47.570 --> 30:48.710
I

30:49.160 --> 30:51.070
haven't seen

30:51.070 --> 30:53.200
such beautiful scenery in a long time.

30:54.780 --> 30:56.180
Since you like it so much,

30:56.920 --> 31:00.250
are you going to take this beautiful view
to your Treasury as well?

31:00.250 --> 31:02.930
You're such a quick-witted,
interesting girl.

31:05.070 --> 31:05.880
However,

31:06.640 --> 31:08.760
you have

31:08.790 --> 31:10.200
a bright future ahead.

31:10.830 --> 31:13.240
Hong Ye is just lucky to have you.

31:14.880 --> 31:15.680
That guy

31:16.550 --> 31:18.000
doesn't treat you well,

31:18.400 --> 31:21.560
still putting on airs like some lord

31:21.750 --> 31:23.270
and acting grumpy.

31:24.680 --> 31:26.380
He may look grumpy,

31:26.510 --> 31:28.080
but he's actually quite sweet.

31:28.080 --> 31:29.600
He treats me very well.

31:30.520 --> 31:33.650
Besides, you've already
taught him quite a few lessons.

31:36.660 --> 31:38.240
Since you defend him so much,

31:38.240 --> 31:41.550
I won't be too hard on him.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.880
In this world,

31:47.110 --> 31:48.820
there are comings and goings,

31:49.240 --> 31:50.790
gatherings and partings.

31:52.350 --> 31:54.320
It is my duty

31:54.880 --> 31:56.560
to guard the West Coast.

31:56.750 --> 31:58.420
I cannot leave,

31:58.480 --> 32:01.010
but I shouldn't
keep you trapped here either.

32:03.420 --> 32:05.160
That boy has lost all his power,

32:05.160 --> 32:06.890
yet with no external injuries.

32:07.480 --> 32:08.520
I guess

32:08.550 --> 32:11.280
it was caused
by the Heart-Burning Incantation.

32:11.890 --> 32:14.240
You came here looking for the Sky Stone

32:14.620 --> 32:15.490
just in order

32:16.290 --> 32:19.750
to find a way to remove
the Heart-Burning Incantation, right?

32:19.940 --> 32:21.300
You knew it?

32:22.270 --> 32:24.660
I thought you would

32:24.830 --> 32:26.410
try to steal it

32:27.070 --> 32:29.680
or fool me around

32:29.700 --> 32:31.730
to make off with some treasures.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.840
But unexpectedly,

32:33.890 --> 32:37.670
I deliberately gave you
a chance to make requests,

32:37.920 --> 32:40.190
hinted at it, and tried to inspire you,

32:41.160 --> 32:44.560
yet you didn't say a word about it.

32:49.130 --> 32:50.410
I

32:50.920 --> 32:52.720
haven't had

32:52.720 --> 32:54.680
such joyful days in a long time.

32:57.070 --> 32:59.000
I really hate to see you go.

33:02.210 --> 33:04.380
I wish I could keep you here longer.

33:13.950 --> 33:14.500
Girl,

33:14.550 --> 33:15.880
what are you doing?

33:15.880 --> 33:16.910
Get up. Come on.

33:17.750 --> 33:18.400
Sir.

33:19.830 --> 33:22.090
I'm not trying to exploit your kindness.

33:22.790 --> 33:24.250
But the Sky Stone really is

33:24.960 --> 33:27.030
Hong Ye's last glimmer of hope.

33:28.400 --> 33:30.000
I know you don't like Hong Ye,

33:30.350 --> 33:33.040
but he did lose his power because of me.

33:33.510 --> 33:35.640
He's also the one all demons look up to.

33:36.270 --> 33:37.920
I, Xiao Yao, sincerely hope you

33:37.920 --> 33:39.320
can lend us the Sky Stone.

33:39.790 --> 33:40.510
I swear,

33:40.850 --> 33:42.490
when his power is restored,

33:42.520 --> 33:44.450
we will return the treasure to you.

33:47.880 --> 33:48.680
Seems like

33:51.160 --> 33:54.530
he truly is
the greatest treasure in your heart.

34:22.030 --> 34:22.560
Thank...

34:26.800 --> 34:29.489
I can't bear to see you go.

34:31.230 --> 34:32.449
Don't worry, sir.

34:32.670 --> 34:34.280
When we return this treasure,

34:34.280 --> 34:36.080
we'll meet again.

34:40.000 --> 34:42.630
You're the first one to take a treasure

34:42.630 --> 34:44.290
from the Treasure Swallower.

34:45.920 --> 34:46.650
Little Lord,

34:47.800 --> 34:49.560
take good care of Xiao Yao.

34:49.920 --> 34:52.380
-Otherwise, I...
-There's no "otherwise."

34:54.960 --> 34:56.760
I will certainly treat her well.

34:56.880 --> 34:59.140
I won't give you any chance to intervene.

35:07.800 --> 35:09.480
I've asked him for you.

35:11.720 --> 35:14.170
He said he'd risk his life to protect you.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.210
It seems

35:17.560 --> 35:20.060
that he truly cares for you.

35:21.220 --> 35:22.860
Next time you visit,

35:22.890 --> 35:25.290
remember to bring me your wedding candies.

35:25.880 --> 35:26.920
Sir!

35:28.070 --> 35:29.600
What are you talking about?

35:30.360 --> 35:32.080
I'm not telling you.

35:39.590 --> 35:40.660
Thank you, sir.

35:43.560 --> 35:44.820
I'll take my leave now.

35:47.090 --> 35:48.430
Get going now!

35:49.480 --> 35:51.230
Or I might change my mind.

36:11.910 --> 36:14.370
What did that old jerk say to you
at the end?

36:17.000 --> 36:17.730
Take a guess.

36:20.230 --> 36:20.670
Okay.

36:21.470 --> 36:22.530
Give me a hint then.

36:23.320 --> 36:23.920
Come here.

36:26.710 --> 36:27.280
What?

36:28.640 --> 36:29.490
Come closer.

37:11.150 --> 37:13.800
There were still cries
from this furnace the other day.

37:13.800 --> 37:15.730
But today, there's no sound at all.

37:16.480 --> 37:19.010
Could it be that the pill is
already complete?

37:19.880 --> 37:21.150
It's said that this time,

37:21.150 --> 37:23.090
they're refining
a great demon from ancient times.

37:23.090 --> 37:24.370
If the pill is successfully made,

37:24.370 --> 37:27.230
it could ensure
His Majesty's health for 100 years.

37:30.330 --> 37:33.250
I wonder what makes this pill
so different.

37:35.630 --> 37:36.760
Can you see clearly?

37:38.190 --> 37:39.590
It's all just flames.

38:18.730 --> 38:20.100
Humans!

38:20.290 --> 38:21.880
I will make you

38:22.030 --> 38:24.560
suffer eternal damnation!

38:37.760 --> 38:39.160
You good-for-nothings.

38:39.880 --> 38:40.880
How incompetent.

38:42.110 --> 38:43.170
Useless wretches!

38:46.510 --> 38:48.240
You can't find the Yuli Spring,

38:50.800 --> 38:52.480
and you let the captured demon escape.

38:52.480 --> 38:54.940
What are you, the Feiyu Guards,
even good at?

38:54.960 --> 38:56.760
Please punish us, Your Majesty.

39:08.480 --> 39:09.550
Heed my decree.

39:10.230 --> 39:12.590
All officers, heed the decree!

39:15.710 --> 39:18.420
The Feiyu Guards must eliminate

39:18.510 --> 39:21.940
all demon threats in Tiansheng Kingdom
within 1 month.

39:23.110 --> 39:24.550
If after 1 month,

39:25.030 --> 39:27.290
there are still demons causing trouble,

39:27.670 --> 39:29.670
the Feiyu Guards will be disbanded,

39:30.000 --> 39:31.490
and all of you...

39:31.590 --> 39:34.390
I promise I will do my utmost

39:34.630 --> 39:36.890
and not fail your command, Your Majesty.

39:37.530 --> 39:38.630
Otherwise, you'll face

39:38.630 --> 39:39.760
deaths by 1,000 cuts

39:39.880 --> 39:41.880
and execution of your entire clans.

40:12.840 --> 40:15.500
So back then, the Heavenly Mother
used the Heart-Burning Incantation

40:15.500 --> 40:17.670
and activated an array to reverse time,

40:17.670 --> 40:19.580
allowing herself to return
to the beginning of creation.

40:19.580 --> 40:21.230
She needed to find her younger self

40:21.230 --> 40:22.320
to retrieve her primordial spirit

40:22.320 --> 40:23.980
in order to restore her power.

40:24.420 --> 40:25.670
Did she succeed then?
